  "additional": {
    "aboutAssay": "",
    "forReview": "The kit is functional as the standard curve looks good. However, it did not detect any of the serum samples across the dilution. The spike recovery is below 50%.\nIt appears there is a matrix effect, and also the coated antigen may be limited in binding equine serum leptin, although this kit is designed to detect horse leptin. \n\nBased on these results, we are not confident that this kit can reliably measure leptin in equine serum."
  },
